  "description": "After returning from military service, Min-woo attends a nude croquis class in his university major. The model is nothing short of perfection—a body and face that can only be described as god-given. Min-woo falls head over heels for him. As an ordinary, inexperienced guy, Min-woo is content just to have glimpsed him and occasionally enjoys “happy times” imagining his face and body. Three years later, now a webtoon artist who has just finished a project, Min-woo unexpectedly gets in contact with a famous nude croquis model through other artists.\n\n[“Looking for a private nude croquis model.”]\n\n*“Hello, are you really looking for a nude croquis model?”*\n\nTo his surprise, the model is none other than the same man he fell for three years ago. His excitement is short-lived when he realizes something strange—why isn’t the model posing? And why is he coming toward Min-woo… undressing him? A chaotic and steamy romance unfolds between the openly perverted Si-hoo and subtly kinky Min-woo.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/961088012), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/wait), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/stop_dont_move), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13119223), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000068104) \n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/thwt_4103)",
